{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally found the ancient temple of <i>Quetzalcoatl</i>. There is a problem though, It's protected by a curse. Anyone that enters is stuck in a loop and can't ever escape. Fortunately, you found an old note of an adventurer that might have figured how to break the spell. However, as you found the note right next to their remains, it's probably not going to be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/4cd2ca5b1c4a3003f72995b5b41b8062.poster.avif?t=1774567168\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/4cd2ca5b1c4a3003f72995b5b41b8062.webm?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/4cd2ca5b1c4a3003f72995b5b41b8062.mp4?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look For Anomalies To Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to find 5 golden skulls to get out of the temple. But be careful, some of them are cursed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything is exactly as it should be, you can safely take the skull.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything is wrong in the temple, do NOT grab the skull.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let this distract you from the deadly traps all around the temple, any mistake would be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/7ab3888b3e05a711ef000b1bf64c3e29.poster.avif?t=1774567168\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/7ab3888b3e05a711ef000b1bf64c3e29.webm?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/7ab3888b3e05a711ef000b1bf64c3e29.mp4?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play in online coop. It's the perfect game to play for a quick fun with friends. A few more eyes will prove very useful to spot the most challenging anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit 8-like anomaly game, but with fresh ideas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online coop multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short runs, ideal for short sessions with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 unique anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of secrets.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993250?t=1774567168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/76e87035118f05d23c4b6b05bdd357f0d9241f9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774567168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/76330261f6c04adba1a8ae7ca622182e197bfb9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774567168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/76330261f6c04adba1a8ae7ca622182e197bfb9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774567168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally found the ancient temple of <i>Quetzalcoatl</i>. There is a problem though, It's protected by a curse. Anyone that enters is stuck in a loop and can't ever escape. Fortunately, you found an old note of an adventurer that might have figured how to break the spell. However, as you found the note right next to their remains, it's probably not going to be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/4cd2ca5b1c4a3003f72995b5b41b8062.poster.avif?t=1774567168\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/4cd2ca5b1c4a3003f72995b5b41b8062.webm?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/4cd2ca5b1c4a3003f72995b5b41b8062.mp4?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Look For Anomalies To Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to find 5 golden skulls to get out of the temple. But be careful, some of them are cursed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything is exactly as it should be, you can safely take the skull.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything is wrong in the temple, do NOT grab the skull.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let this distract you from the deadly traps all around the temple, any mistake would be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/7ab3888b3e05a711ef000b1bf64c3e29.poster.avif?t=1774567168\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/7ab3888b3e05a711ef000b1bf64c3e29.webm?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/extras/7ab3888b3e05a711ef000b1bf64c3e29.mp4?t=1774567168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play in online coop. It's the perfect game to play for a quick fun with friends. A few more eyes will prove very useful to spot the most challenging anomalies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit 8-like anomaly game, but with fresh ideas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online coop multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short runs, ideal for short sessions with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 unique anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of secrets.</p></li></ul>","developers":["YorshInGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/c0c315c9931dbc45ee2c7dabb3cd6a8e93f1d299/header.jpg?t=1774567168","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993250/341877526/006187443cdf0dfd568315d1f746b7bf77c2da76/1767554068/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768000464","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993250/341877526/006187443cdf0dfd568315d1f746b7bf77c2da76/1767554068/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768000464","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993250/341877526/006187443cdf0dfd568315d1f746b7bf77c2da76/1767554068/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768000464","id":257208935,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208935